<cap:headline>River Gandak at Dumariaghat in Gopalganj district of Bihar continues to flow in severe flood situation at 6:00 am today.</cap:headline>
<cap:description>River Gandak at Dumariaghat in Gopalganj district of Bihar continues to flow in severe flood situation at 6:00 am today. At 6:00 am, it was flowing at a level of 62.23 m with steady trend which is 0.01 m above its Danger Level of 62.22 m and 2.13 m below its previous HFL of 64.36 m (24/07/2020).</cap:description>
